Audience ai tasks that can be delegated
title end

paragraph start
An AI may sort and count collected comments, group similar problems, extract exact phrases, draft interview questions and fill the ranked problem list from notes.
paragraph end

paragraph start
An AI may not invent audience facts, estimate numbers without data, or contact people.
paragraph end

